Z||000021||JSocha||11-09-2001||09:22 AM||||I don't know.<P>Wife watches and/or listens to CMT all the time.  When I watch it, to me it looks like the country singer trying to be a "Rock-'n-Roll Wannabe".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Me, AC/DC, Van Halen, Autograph, White Lion, White Snake, Eric Clampton, Poison, Cinderella, KISS, Scorpions, Def Leppard, Metalica, Guns-n-Roses, ZZ Top...you get the picture.  Anything with good solid guitar riffs, good beat and tempo.<P>Not this contemporary Back Street Boys, hip-hop, regge, rap-Crap.<P>We have a policy when we drive someplace.  "The one who drives the vehicle gets to listen to the radio station of their choice."  My wife plays country when she drives.  When I drive and she tunes it to country, it puts me to sleep-period, which is why when she drives, I am able to take a nap because it is so boreeeeeeee.....ing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
